# November 23, 2026: Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania (region paw). The first places in the city of Pittsburgh: downtown on
# Grant's Hill, the university and museum quarter in Oakland, the North Side, the South Side inclines, East Liberty,
# Lawrenceville and Troy Hill. The names came from a video walk-through of the city's old buildings, taken as a tip
# only; every fact here comes from the linked sources. Wikipedia articles were read as raw text; hours come from the
# pages of the bodies that run each place, read the same day, or are left blank where those pages gave none.
# Pins: ArcGIS PointAddress matches for street addresses and OpenStreetMap points, looked at on the state leaf-off aerial.
